- **`index.html`** - Single-page dashboard with:
  - Pi SDK initialization in Mainnet mode (`sandbox: false`)
  - Pi Wallet authentication flow with username/payments scopes
  - Protection system test panel with blacklist, dust attack, and clean transaction scenarios
  - Console log for real-time event display
  - Cyberpunk-styled UI (dark theme, monospace fonts, green accents)

### Configuration
Update `BACKEND_URL` constant after Railway deployment:
```javascript
