Plugin UI renders blank when loaded in Pixso's iframe environment. Direct mounting to `document.body` is unreliable in the plugin context.

## Changes

- **`ui/ui.html`**: Add `<div id="root"></div>` container element
- **`ui/index.tsx`**: Mount Preact app to `#root` with null check

```tsx
// Before
render(<App />, document.body);

// After
const root = document.getElementById('root');
if (root) {
  render(<App />, root);
}
```

